    "kx.accordion.hint.collapse" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver only, never shown on screen, so there is no length limit. Hint read after an expanded accordion row: what a double tap does (it hides the answer below the title). Short sentence in the third person, like the iOS system hints.",
